OL,3,GNEWSACouples urged to stop leaving love
OL,4,Alocks on bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FLoved-up couples are being urged not to
OL,7,Fleave padlocks on a Worcestershire
OL,8,Ffootbridge due to maintenance
OL,9,Fcomplications.
OL,11,FWorcestershire County Council removed
OL,12,Fthe locks - also known as love locks -
OL,13,Fon Tuesday at the Sabrina Footbridge in
OL,14,FWorcester to carry out essential
OL,15,Fmaintenance work.
OL,17,FA deadline was set on the authority's
OL,18,FFacebook page for couples to collect
OL,19,Flocks they wanted to keep, with all
OL,20,Funclaimed ones to be stored at its
OL,21,Fheadquarters in Wildwood, Worcester,
OL,22,Funtil the end of September.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
