OL,3,GNEWSACouples urged to stop leaving love
OL,4,Alocks on bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said it recognised the
OL,7,F"symbolism" of couples placing locks on
OL,8,Fthe bridge, but warned the locks could
OL,9,Falso "lead to early deterioration" of
OL,10,Fthe structure.
